<title>MOROCCO: Libyans seek business opportunities in Morocco.</title>
<headline>Libyans seek business opportunities in Morocco.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libyan Minister of Industry and Mines Muftah Azzouz was visiting Morocco's financial centre of Casablanca with a delegation of businessmen looking for business opportunities, a Moroccan official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Azzouz is expected to meet the Moroccan Trade Minister Driss Jettou. Morocco and Libya are members of the five-nation Arab Maghreb Union that also includes Algeria, Tunisia and Mauritania.</p>
</text>
